UP Health is intentionally sequenced ahead of Tessera’s eventual public launch. The intent
is to ship something genuinely useful and low-risk first, establish a visible and credible track
record within the LUKSO community as a builder, and return to Tessera’s launch afterward
with considerably more trust and support already in place.
